<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2104_7885.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Wolgeachte, Edle, Gestrennge, Frome, Veste, Eerenveste, Fuersichtige
<lb n="2"/>Eersame unnd Waiße, innsonnders großguenstige liebe Herrenn,
<lb n="3"/>guote fruend, unnd verthrawte Nachpuren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachdem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allentwegen</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pfruondthauß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Johannen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrewenn</unclear>,
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kirchendiennern</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermassenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bawfellig</unclear> unnd in
<lb n="6"/>abganng gerathen, daß unnsere Herrenn und Predicanten.
<lb n="7"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> woll aufhaltenn schiermen noch die behaußung
<lb n="8"/>bewonnen koennen. Darumb wir großer Nothurft nach, zuo
<lb n="9"/>irer beßerer unnderhaltung unnd Ruewigerm studiern,
<lb n="10"/>die ermelte alte behaußung abzuebrechen. uß gedachter ursachen
<lb n="11"/>unnd ain Newe annstath der alten, Irem stanndt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ampt</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hofstath</unclear> unnd grund ufzebuwen getrungenh
<lb n="13"/>wordenn. etc. Welches aber unns (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innansehen</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>der geringen Pfruenden, wie auch der Kirchen Inckhumens,
<lb n="15"/>schlechtes vermoegens. Aller die wir vonn unnßern mitburgern
<lb n="16"/>paepstischer Relligionn laider Entdsaezt. unnd aber dargegen an
<lb n="17"/>aigenn sitzenn, daß wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuemer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonderß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedoerftlich</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>sind) onne guotherziger Christenlicher leuthenn (wie dann daß-
<lb n="19"/>selbig durch unns unnd der Evangellischenn Edlenn unnd
<lb n="20"/>Grichtsherrenn, auch anndern der Warhait liebhabenden
<lb n="21"/>Persohnnen, Stet unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thurgoew</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steur</unclear> unnd hanndtreichung
<lb n="22"/>so uß Warer lieb, deßenn wir unnß zum <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechstenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuebe</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danckhenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ietzuen</unclear> rychlich dargewendt. Hilf unnd hanndt
<lb n="24"/>raichung die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Warer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>:
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> aber unnßer Comun ebenn chlain, unnd der wenig-
<lb n="26"/>iste thaill großes vermoegennß sind. unnd unnß nit Allain
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewußt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">teglichenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoerenn</unclear>. waß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">großen</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmuoßenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuertreffenliche</unclear> lieb-
<lb n="29"/>haber, stifter unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wahrenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christen</unclear>-
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lichenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Relligionn</unclear>.) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allennthalbenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miltigklich</unclear> unnd rych-
<lb n="31"/>lich mithaillenn thund. etc. Wie dan ouch vor.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2104_7886.jpg" n="2"/>
